# StudyVerce overview

- **Stack**: pnpm + Turborepo, Next.js 16 (`apps/web`, port 3001), Supabase Postgres + RLS, Socket.io room realtime, Redis (`packages/redis`) for presence, chat/auth/profile caches, listing, post-it lazy persist, rate limits.
- **Shared types**: `packages/shared/src/index.ts` — import `@studyverce/shared`.
- **Server actions**: `apps/web/src/app/**/actions.ts` or `task-actions.ts`; use `createClient()` from `@/lib/supabase/server`.
- **Client Supabase**: `@/lib/supabase/client` for browser fetches (post-its in rooms).

## Conventions

- Prefer small, focused diffs; reuse existing components and naming.
- UI: Tailwind 4, `cn()` from `@/lib/utils`, lucide icons, glass panels in rooms (`bg-card/90 backdrop-blur-md`).
- Do not commit `.env.local` or secrets.
- Run `pnpm --filter web exec tsc --noEmit` after TypeScript changes.
- **Skills**: read `.cursor/skills/` before feature work; update skills + `AGENTS.md` when behavior changes (rule `skills-maintenance.mdc`).

## Feature boundaries

- **Dashboard**: stats shell (`dashboard-shell.tsx`); global navbar hidden via `conditional-navbar.tsx`.
- **Rooms**: post-its, pomodoro, chat, music, wallpapers, participant menu (search, friend/kick), favorites, share — orchestrated in `room-client.tsx`. See skill `studyverce-rooms`.
- **Room listing** (`/rooms`): tabs (trending/private/friends/favorites), live presence badges, favorite hearts on cards.
- **Post-its**: room-only; see rule `post-it-notes.mdc` and skill `studyverce-post-it-notes`.
